## Security Contract (non-negotiable)

{{ security_rules }}

**Additional backend rules:**
- Every route that accesses a resource by ID must verify the caller owns it (`org_id` / `user_id` check) — no IDOR
- All database queries use ORM or parameterised statements — zero string interpolation in SQL
- Auth middleware must be applied at the router level, not duplicated per-route
- Rate limiting applied on all auth endpoints per security-model.md specs
- Never log passwords, tokens, or PII — use structlog with explicit field allowlisting

